{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>יגמא ארץ</b> — it swallows the ground. And close to it is מגמת פניהם, and the meaning is 'before their faces' [i.e., directed straight ahead]; so much does it hear to go to the place of battle, that it does not believe the sound of the shofar is real."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:17.285034121Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}